      "body": "Repo: https://github.com/w2xi/v-rapper-mcp\n\n## How to use\n\nAdd the following `v-rapper-mcp` to your configuration:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"v-rapper-mcp\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\n        \"v-rapper-mcp\"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nAnd then, just enjoy it!!!\n\n<img width=\"641\" height=\"429\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15a3a1fd-8bf4-4262-9ccd-c06b67d32bb1\" />",
